# Local/editor noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Rust and JavaScript build output
target/
**/target/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Throwaway prototype output and evidence
prototypes/**/build/
prototypes/**/evidence/
prototypes/**/gen/
prototypes/**/vendor/
prototypes/**/__pycache__/
